{
  "_doc": "Crow-Eye consolidated identity-column registry. Single source of truth for every column name that the correlation engines AND the EYE Agent should check when extracting or tracking an identity from a forensic record. Mirrors the shape of timestamps.json: top-level keys are identity categories, values are ordered lists of column-name synonyms (most-specific first). Loaded by utils.standard_fields.StandardFields via the standard JSON loader. Categories deliberately overlap with the per-artifact files (process_identifiers.json / file_paths.json / user_identifiers.json / system_identifiers.json / event_identifiers.json / network_identifiers.json) so this file alone can answer 'what columns might carry this identity?' without consulting the others.",

